# Python tools for the pre-commit hooks (scripts/setup-hooks.sh). The hashed
# lock, requirements-dev.txt, is generated from this file; floors only, the lock
# holds the exact versions. Python 3.11 and later: 3.10 reaches end of life this month, and the
# fixed releases of black, filelock, requests and urllib3 do not support older ones.
#   uv pip compile scripts/requirements-dev.in --generate-hashes --universal --python-version 3.11 -o scripts/requirements-dev.txt
# Check the result against OSV before committing: a lock of pinned versions is
# read by OpenSSF Scorecard, and an affected version there is a standing alert.
